and business address; (c) Payment and financial information such as credit card details, bank account information, and billing addresses (processed directly by our PCI-compliant payment processors — we do not store full card numbers); (d) Identity verification documents such as government-issued IDs and passports; (e) Communication records including emails, chat messages, and support tickets.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3. Information Collected Automatically\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"3. Information Collected Automatically\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"When you visit our website, we automatically collect: (a) Device and browser information including IP address, browser type, operating system, and device identifiers; (b) Usage data including pages visited, time spent, links clicked, and navigation patterns; (c) Cookies and similar tracking technologies as described in our Cookie Policy.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4. How We Use Your Information\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"4. How We Use Your Information\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"We use your information for the following purposes: (a) To provide, process, and manage your service requests and business formation; (b) To communicate with you about your account, services, and support inquiries; (c) To process payments and prevent fraudulent transactions; (d) To comply with legal obligations including anti-money laundering (AML) and Know Your Customer (KYC) requirements; (e) To improve our website, services, and user experience; (f) To send service-related notices, updates, and security alerts; (g) To enforce our terms, policies, and legal agreements.\\\"}]]}],\\\"$L37\\\",\\\"$L38\\\",\\\"$L39\\\",\\\"$L3a\\\",\\\"$L3b\\\",\\\"$L3c\\\",\\\"$L3d\\\",\\\"$L3e\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"$L40\\\",\\\"$L41\\\"]}]]}]}]}],[\\\"$L42\\\",\\\"$L43\\\"],\\\"$L44\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"45:[]\\n26:\\\"$W45\\\"\\n27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$3\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L46\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L47\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L48\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$49\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.Metadata\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L4a\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"next-size-adjust\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"\\\"}]]}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ct-sps8aufrd.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0djcck_ky6z0o.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"4b:I[76779,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0w2c.i2ky0ich.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0anfux3ged1uf.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09l_6s1m2kd2f.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/02b7ej9gu8jmt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0wlqa3t_j6b22.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0t698yywsb5~-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0xjrnv1po9n~0.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1181pbou.tkp3.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0c-0zwsf8nv_k.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14p1p_ukyy748.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2c\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/services\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"AI \\u0026 Automation\\\"}]\\n2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"Services-Cloud \\u0026 Data\\\